### 要跑的 4 段查询

**Q1：在整台服务器上找 source list 表**

这段要整段一起执行。它会把你有权限的每个库都搜一遍，顺便找 TCURR 和 EBAN，用来判断 SAP 的镜像表放在哪个库。

```sql
IF OBJECT_ID('tempdb..#hits') IS NOT NULL DROP TABLE #hits;
CREATE TABLE #hits (DB sysname, TABLE_SCHEMA sysname, TABLE_NAME sysname, TABLE_TYPE varchar(20));
DECLARE @db sysname, @q nvarchar(max);
DECLARE c CURSOR LOCAL FAST_FORWARD FOR
    SELECT name FROM sys.databases WHERE state_desc = 'ONLINE' AND HAS_DBACCESS(name) = 1;
OPEN c;
FETCH NEXT FROM c INTO @db;
WHILE @@FETCH_STATUS = 0
BEGIN
    SET @q = N'SELECT ' + QUOTENAME(@db, '''') + N', TABLE_SCHEMA, TABLE_NAME, TABLE_TYPE FROM '
           + QUOTENAME(@db) + N'.INFORMATION_SCHEMA.TABLES WHERE TABLE_NAME LIKE ''%EORD%'''
           + N' OR TABLE_NAME LIKE ''%SOURCE%'' OR TABLE_NAME LIKE ''%SRC%L%ST%'''
           + N' OR TABLE_NAME LIKE ''%EBAN%'' OR TABLE_NAME LIKE ''%TCURR%''';
    BEGIN TRY
        INSERT INTO #hits EXEC sp_executesql @q;
    END TRY
    BEGIN CATCH
        PRINT 'skipped ' + @db;
    END CATCH;
    FETCH NEXT FROM c INTO @db;
END;
CLOSE c;
DEALLOCATE c;
SELECT * FROM #hits ORDER BY DB, TABLE_NAME;
```

如果搜到了，再对那张表跑一句 `SELECT TOP 20 * FROM [库].[schema].[表名]`，结果一起发我。

